  "name": "Setis: the shrine takes the raid to his map, he pays every player and leaves a portal back",
  "contract": [
    "rev_20261104_10_coa_setis_world_boss spawns the Shrine of Setis (64600) by the Scarab Wall. On a",
    "heroic raid difficulty it refuses. His map (880) opens with Zul'Gurub: at release stage 2 the shrine",
    "leaves the player in Silithus, and at stage 3 its gossip 'Challenge Setis the Gate Warden' on a Normal",
    "difficulty takes the player to Setis' map (880). Setis (64600) has 470000 health per player, counted from 10 to",
    "40, so 4700000 for one player. For a single player he drops one epic item of item level 68 (one for",
    "every four players, never none), and every player gets 250 Runes of Ascension (375250), 100 to 150",
    "Bazaar Tokens (975001) and a Treasures of Azeroth chest (1615011). The Portal to the Scarab Wall",
    "(64601) appears at its fixed spot at the end of the road (-7970.9, 1507.22) and takes the player",
    "back to Silithus (map 1). His loot always holds the Idol of the Old Gods (1005032). A character who",
    "logs in inside his map stays there at stage 3 and is moved out at stage 2. The case clears the stage",
    "override when it ends, also after a failure."
  ],
